    "description": "Title of a skill’s switch in Settings, in the learner’s words. The skill is production: the learner sees the meaning and writes the word, by choosing, putting tiles in order or typing. Sentence case. Elsewhere the skill keeps its short name."
  },
  "skillProductionSettingsOn": "See the meaning, write the word",
