  "skillPairSettingsTitle": "Phonemic contrasts",
  "@skillPairSettingsTitle": {
    "description": "Title of the switch in Settings that turns the minimal-pairs skill on. Used in Settings only: everywhere else that skill is called skillPair, Minimal pairs. Switching it on lets the learner practise the sounds of the language they learn that the languages they speak do not have, and the differences between them. Sentence case, like the other Settings titles."
  },
