    "description": "Under a skill’s switch in Settings, while it is on. The skill is Phonemic contrasts: practice with the sounds of the language learned that the languages the learner knows (Languages I know) do not have. Shown while the switch is on: says what happens now, and changes the moment it is flipped."
  },
  "skillPairSettingsOff": "No practice with sounds your languages lack",
